flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T19:28:47.0043078Z ^[[0m
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T19:28:47.0043780Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T19:28:47.0044511Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T19:28:47.0044802Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T19:28:47.0045051Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T19:28:47.0046030Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T19:28:47.0046390Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T19:28:47.0046632Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T19:28:47.0047130Z    if you are ready to continue.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T19:28:47.0047364Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T19:28:47.0047793Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T19:28:47.0048444Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T19:28:47.0049084Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T19:28:47.0049654Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T19:28:47.0049881Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T19:28:47.0050166Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T19:28:47.0050506Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T19:28:47.0050766Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T19:28:47.0052011Z    can use Nix.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T19:28:47.0052205Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T19:28:47.0052356Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T19:28:47.0052581Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T19:28:47.0052943Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T19:28:47.0053536Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T19:28:47.0055822Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T19:28:47.0056042Z I will:
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T19:28:47.0056396Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T19:28:47.0056776Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T19:28:47.0057563Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T19:28:47.0058385Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T19:28:47.0059175Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T19:28:47.0059951Z  - install Nix in /nix
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T19:28:47.0060386Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T19:28:47.0060898Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T19:28:47.0061612Z    /root
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T19:28:47.0070308Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T19:28:47.0071451Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T19:28:47.0082624Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T19:28:47.0083550Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
